#~ msgstr "NOSSOS PROFESSORES"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Our team is made up of educators with over 5 years of experience and "
#~ "academic training in Massachusetts."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Nossa equipe é formada por educadores com mais de 5 anos de experiência e "
#~ "formação acadêmica em Massachusetts."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The director, Marcela Vitor, is a speech-language pathologist with 9 "
#~ "years of experience in the state education system and a strong background "
#~ "in both public and private schools."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A diretora, Marcela Vitor, é fonoaudióloga com 9 anos de experiência no "
